This directory contains the generated C code for SUPL and LPP.

Generated by asn1c at Tue Apr  9 16:14:47 CEST 2024
    commit: 940dd5fa9f3917913fd487b13dfddfacd0ded06e
    version: 0.9.29
    branch: vlm_master
    repository: https://github.com/mouse07410/asn1c


skeleton/ is the asn1c runtime copied from upstream (see above). It carries local
patches, kept as files in patches/ so that they can be reapplied after the skeleton is
refreshed from upstream. patches/ is the source of truth: when changing skeleton/, add or
update a patch there and report the issue upstream.

Apply to a freshly copied upstream skeleton (in order, from this directory):

    for p in patches/*.patch; do patch -p1 < "$p"; done

Each patch has a short description at the top. The helper/ directory is not upstream code
and is not covered by this.
